   [
    "What does each plan cover?",
    "Starter includes one free tow every 6 months (up to 5 miles), one free jump start and lockout per month, and fuel delivery. Plus adds one free tow every 3 months, towing up to 15 miles and flat tire changes. Pro includes everything in Plus, towing up to 30 miles, roadside for any driver and priority response."
