   [
    "Which vehicles qualify for free towing?",
    "Free towing covers vehicles under 6k GVWR."
   ],
   [
    "How do I request help?",
    "Members request help in the D&D app: pick the service, share your location, choose standard or urgent, and ASAP or a scheduled time. Prefer to talk? Call the 24/7 hotline at (563) 580-3447."
   ],
   [
    "When does my coverage start?",
    "Coverage starts immediately when you sign up, and you can upgrade anytime."
   ],
   [
    "Is fuel included with fuel delivery?",
    "Fuel delivery is included on every plan. The price of the fuel itself is not included."
   ],
   [
    "Can I save by paying yearly?",
    "Yes. Annual plans get one month free, and prices include 5.5% sales tax."
   ],
   [
    "Can I add my family?",
    "Refer a family member and they get 25% off every month for as long as they stay subscribed."
